			"date": "2023-02-14T19:29:15.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> From memory HTML Imports got scrapped because no other browser would support it</p><p>There were also some performance concerns but not sure they were any worse than render blocking JS or CSS @import</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
