			"date": "2023-02-15T01:49:29.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> the first thing to figure out always is semantics. Once you have that figured out you can import into multiple places. And HTML Modules will be importable into HTML from the start, with a &lt;script&gt; tag.</p>",
