			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@justinfagnani\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>justinfagnani</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> Looking forward to testing the options—but I will say that importing HTML via `&lt;script&gt;` is a progressive enhancement code smell for me. Hopefully that’s just an academic complaint and irrelevant practically.</p>",
